msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Состояние Удалённого Сборщика Данных:"

#: include/global_settings.php:485
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
